  "id": "thought-broadcasting",
  "term": "thought broadcasting",
  "definition": "Thought broadcasting is the perceived experience that one’s thoughts are leaking out or becoming known to other people. In this source, it is described as part of a broader self-leakage phenomenon involving personal internal information seeming to escape.",
